1
00:00:00,847 --> 00:00:06,587
This video is for the driver. You don't need an account, only your phone camera and one link.

2
00:00:07,037 --> 00:00:11,290
Procurement sends you the link once. Add it to your phone home screen.

3
00:00:11,290 --> 00:00:15,057
It shows every box you need to move, from where, and to where.

4
00:00:15,508 --> 00:00:21,578
When you deliver a box, scan its QR sticker with the camera, and choose your language:

5
00:00:21,578 --> 00:00:23,978
Arabic, English, Bengali or Hindi.

6
00:00:24,947 --> 00:00:30,657
Choose where you delivered: the branch or procurement. The destination is chosen for you.

7
00:00:31,107 --> 00:00:36,527
Take a photo of the box; it is required. Write your name once, and the phone remembers it.

8
00:00:36,978 --> 00:00:44,824
Tap Delivered, and the nurse gets a message that the box has arrived. Scan, choose, take a photo, then Delivered.

9
00:00:44,824 --> 00:00:45,518
Thank you!
